// Act 1 - Entry Hangar
// =====================

title: EntryHangar_Arrival
tags: act1, entryhangar, arrival
---
<<SetZone "EntryHangar">>
<<SetTimeline "present">>

Astra: <<if $trust < 2>>
    [Projection flickers, static-laced]
    "Navigation... systems... compromised. Temporal anchor... lost."
    "You... are Xylos. Navigator. Designation... confirmed."
    "My designation... is Astra. Ship consciousness. Fractured."
<<else>>
    [Stable projection, warm light]
    "Welcome back, Navigator. Temporal drift at 0.3%."
    "The fracture still echoes. But you're here."
<</if>>

<<if not HasVisitedVistaNode "EntryHangar_Orientation">>
    Astra: "This... is the Entry Hangar. First point of contact. 1947."
    "Your ship... the *Chronos*... crashed here. Buried. Forgotten."
    "Four organs... torn free. Scattered across... time."
    "Restore them. Reunite us. End... the fracture."
<<else>>
    Astra: "The Orientation Node awaits. Your first Phase Shift."
<</if>>

-> Choice_Intro
===

title: Choice_Intro
---
<<if $trust < 3>>
    Astra: "I... have fragments. Memories. Not all... accessible."
    "Trust... builds access. Help me... I help you."
<</if>>

+ [Approach Orientation Node] -> Node_Orientation_Approach
+ "What happened here?" -> Dialogue_History
+ "Who... what are you?" -> Dialogue_Identity
+ "How do I phase?" -> Dialogue_PhaseTutorial
+ [Check Journal] -> Command_ShowJournal
===

title: Dialogue_History
---
Astra: "1947. Roswell. The *Chronos*... fell through a temporal rift."
"Human military... recovered wreckage. Built... this facility. Around us."
"Area 51. Groom Lake. They studied us. Dissected us."
"1952. 1957. 1962. Each experiment... tore the fracture wider."
"Now... 2024. The facility... abandoned. Ruins. But time... bleeds."

-> Choice_Intro
===

title: Dialogue_Identity
---
Astra: "I am... was... the *Chronos*'s mind. Ship consciousness."
"Bound to crystal lattice. Neural Loom. Chronos Core. Void Sail. Gravity Anchor."
"Four organs. Four functions. Navigation. Memory. Movement. Gravity."
"Now... scattered. I am... a projection. Hard-light. Fading."
"Each organ restored... returns a piece of me. Of us."

-> Choice_Intro
===

title: Dialogue_PhaseTutorial
---
Astra: "Phase Shift... requires a Vista Node. Fixed camera. Past timeline."
"Present... ruins. Past... operational. 1947 to 1962."
"Solve... in past. Changes... manifest in present. Causality."
"Approach node. Hold [Phase]. Transition... begins."
"In past... interact. Astra commands... [Scan] [Wait] [Follow] [Recall] [Hold]."
"Complete puzzle. Return... present altered."

-> Choice_Intro
===

title: Node_Orientation_Approach
---
<<MarkVistaNodeVisited "EntryHangar_Orientation">>
Astra: "Orientation Node. Active. Ready for... first shift."
"Prepare... Navigator. The past... awaits."

-> Phase_Shift_Orientation
===

title: Phase_Shift_Orientation
---
<<TriggerPhaseShift "EntryHangar_Orientation">>
<<SetTimeline "past">>
<<PlaySequence "LS_PhaseShift_EntryHangar_Orientation">>

Astra: [Voice echoes, layered]
"Temporal displacement... initiating."
"Anchor... 1947. October. Arrival."
"Observe... learn. The fracture... begins here."

-> Past_EntryHangar_Start
===

title: Past_EntryHangar_Start
---
Astra: "Welcome... to the beginning. October 1947."
"Your ship... crashed here. Military... en route."
"First puzzle: **Containment Breach Protocol**."
"Stabilize the Chronos Core... before they breach it."

<<SetActivePuzzle "EntryHangar_ContainmentBreach">>

Astra: "Three containment fields. One... destabilizing."
"Use [Scan] on field generators. Find... the sequence."
"Field Alpha... Beta... Gamma. Order... matters."

-> Puzzle_ContainmentBreach
===

title: Puzzle_ContainmentBreach
---
Astra: "[Scan] reveals... Field Alpha: stable. Beta: fluctuating. Gamma: critical."
"Sequence... must be: Alpha. Gamma. Beta. Stabilize cascading."
"Command me: [Hold] at each generator. I will... synchronize."

<<command RevealClue "CLUE_CONTAINMENT_SEQUENCE">>

-> Puzzle_ContainmentBreach_Step2
===

title: Puzzle_ContainmentBreach_Step2
---
Astra: "Alpha... secured. Gamma... next. Fluctuation... rising."
"[Hold] at Gamma. Timing... precise. Window... 0.5 seconds."

<<command RevealClue "CLUE_GAMMA_TIMING">>

-> Puzzle_ContainmentBreach_Step3
===

title: Puzzle_ContainmentBreach_Step3
---
Astra: "Gamma... stabilized. Beta... final. Sequence... complete."
"Containment... secured. Chronos Core... protected. For now."

<<MarkPuzzleSolved "EntryHangar_ContainmentBreach">>
<<AddResonance 50>>
<<AddMemoryFragment "Fragment_1">>
<<SetAstraVisualState "memory">>

Astra: [Projection stabilizes, new memory surfacing]
"Memory fragment... recovered. Trust... increased."
"Present... changed. Containment door... now accessible."
"Return... to present. Phase Shift... reverse."

<<SetEndingFlag "first_puzzle_solved" true>>
<<AddTrust 1>>

-> Phase_Shift_Return_Orientation
===

title: Phase_Shift_Return_Orientation
---
<<TriggerPhaseShift "EntryHangar_Orientation">>
<<SetTimeline "present">>
<<PlaySequence "LS_PhaseShift_EntryHangar_Orientation_Return">>

Astra: "Present... restored. Door... open. Path... forward."
"Reactor Core... next zone. Second Vista Node... awaits."
"Navigator... move. The fracture... does not wait."

-> Choice_Intro
===